Solution Requirements
1. Functional Requirements
User Management

The system should allow creation and management of authorized users.

Role Management

The system should assign appropriate roles to users.

Table Management

The system should provide an Institution Details table for storing project records.

Access Control

The system should control access using ServiceNow ACLs.

Branch-Based Restriction

The system should restrict applicable records according to the Branch field.

CRUD Operations

The system should provide separate access control for:

READ
CREATE
WRITE
DELETE
Administrator Access

Administrators should retain complete access to the records and security configuration.

2. Non-Functional Requirements
Security

The system should prevent unauthorized access.

Reliability

ACL rules should consistently enforce the configured permissions.

Maintainability

The access-control configuration should be easy to understand and maintain.

Usability

Authorized users should be able to perform their permitted operations without unnecessary complexity.
